{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1000_p", "source_sha256": "70d5e382778a3378055c049506091916477ed73f6918879dfbead32b86100445", "ja": "（沖縄でのPV撮影も無事にクランクアップ！\n海の中で撮影したり、大がかりなものになったな）", "zh": "（冲绳的PV拍摄也顺利杀青了！\n还在海里进行拍摄，真是搞得相当大啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "d352574d7aabc1d0054b91b164c9cef34643156136067a37bf13e0031d2c6cdd", "ja": "おやぶーん！　撮影、すっごく面白かった！\n見たことない魚、いっぱい泳いでたぞ～！", "zh": "老大——！拍摄真的超级有意思！\n还有好多从来没见过的鱼在游来游去～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "59eb18bccc9338315e163ff1eb09ba6428498eb21dfa59403e49ebe051a48021", "ja": "変な顔してるのとか、長いのとか……。\nあっ、あとヒトデとかサンゴもあったよ！", "zh": "有长着奇怪脸的，还有长长的……\n啊，还有海星和珊瑚呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1003_p", "source_sha256": "dc081f360febe1ff7a8e39ce82bdd0346624ec6253c2cc4aace2eccba12937d6", "ja": "お疲れさま、環。\n撮影後なのに、まだまだ元気いっぱいって感じだな。", "zh": "辛苦了，环。\n明明拍摄结束了，却还是一副精力十足的样子啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "b5b9ba380ab5e0badcb7e4a52b63edaf584ce0eb296099be83b4de7ee005aa4a", "ja": "うん！　うみみも元気だよ！\n着替えて休憩したら、また泳ぐんだって。", "zh": "嗯！海美也精神十足哦！\n她说换好衣服休息一下后，还要继续游泳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7a162ad7bbb29207a34f4e62fe22c5d9fdc4bbbf9c5055840d97ca8e24e40156", "ja": "そうか。環も一緒に遊んできていいぞ。\nあまり遠くにはいくなよ。", "zh": "这样啊。环也可以一起去玩。\n别跑太远了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "4be8950a0bad462a0e829e889f082270869a62b3d748e43e6051e93536522ff0", "ja": "うん！　じゃあ……あ。\n……やっぱりたまきはいいや。", "zh": "嗯！那就……啊。\n……果然还是算了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d6614b61511d883efa22987802b07ee3c58e8ef433e42b7d814bb80faf52e7c1", "ja": "えっ、いいのか？\nもしかして、本当は疲れちゃったとか……？", "zh": "诶，真的可以吗？\n难道说，其实你已经累了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "447dcc0cfc389d8e7aad24f84a5a6ab59682747aaf11861ea16d4dc9dec8fec1", "ja": "ううん、全然元気だよ！\nけど、うみみはたまきよりずっと元気なんだ～。", "zh": "不是，我精神好着呢！\n不过，海美比小环有活力多了——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "a682624d7a49fb0b6b4b9d8ca70efdd956aa2feed5a1463800e71dd8ba8ec3fc", "ja": "たまき、うみみより肺活量がないから。\n一緒に泳いだら、メーワクかも……。", "zh": "环的肺活量没有海美的大。\n要是一起游泳，可能会给她添麻烦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1010_p", "source_sha256": "20a17a8cdcf9ac09ee5b13e85b410c877066b47e61ec98e35a0b8a0df533d134", "ja": "なるほど、海美に遠慮してるわけか。\n気にする事ないと思うけどな。", "zh": "原来如此，你是因为顾虑海美啊。\n不过我觉得没必要在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8826cc355d72ec1f043a96be0a050a2298baae9ec497c71b9c9bce9fef1323bd", "ja": "一緒の撮影、楽しかったんだろう？\nふたりの笑い声、こっちまで聞こえてたし。", "zh": "一起拍摄很开心吧？\n你们两个人的笑声，我在这边都听得见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "de374748fa870e4fbc56e50f6077807a0d4f348c061e2770c35c618c239ecd6f", "ja": "うん、すっごく楽しかった！\nうみみと一緒に、いっぱい笑ったぞ～♪", "zh": "嗯，超级开心的！\n我和海美美一起笑了好久呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "cc486e1d08c5d4e52d181b5633c2ee7eda67eb553436cc6fa08d22b855174563", "ja": "笑いすぎて、ぶくぶくーってなっちゃって、\n息継ぎが大変だったんだ。", "zh": "笑得太厉害了，结果变得咕嘟咕嘟的，换气可费劲了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1014_p", "source_sha256": "86ca6760aae23d4ded35fb204572452086e2c847d73a79d954a14eced947db7c", "ja": "うん。それは海美も同じだと思うよ。\nもっと環と遊びたいと思ってるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "嗯。我想海美也是一样的想法哦。\n她应该也想多和环一起玩吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "a4fcda5de3fb8ca0f81cf874ae1ea963a42e7c1c0fe85a54872e8071124554c5", "ja": "たまきも！　もっとうみみと遊びたい！", "zh": "环也一样！我还想和海美玩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1016_p", "source_sha256": "6eda45faf57ccb689557df352a13c5698ed3a2ba629f55b7581926afa06a8b25", "ja": "だったら、思いっきり遊んだらいいじゃないか。\nまだ日は高いんだから。", "zh": "既然这样，那就尽情玩个痛快吧。\n现在时间还早着呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "83346671c7f143ea76e06a1683b3090d8b6b9334bf4bef1fe37ad5b73b123bc1", "ja": "そっか！　わかったよおやぶん。\nたまき、うみみとたくさん遊んでくる！　くふふ♪", "zh": "这样啊！明白了，老大。  \n环要和海美玩个痛快！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "dd1190110b7700ccf59a6b09cc17033ad41491aac8c8b38c0d6f7ec4a6d54be6", "ja": "そうだっ！　おやぶんも！\nおやぶんも一緒に泳ごうよ～。", "zh": "对了！老大也来！\n老大也一起游泳吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "9eed2fb3e643bc4cf099821f0c97d08b1fb7b3136f41411c0ed6ff934e3ccc2a", "ja": "たまきたちと、競争しよう！\n誰がいちばん速く泳げるか、勝負だぞ～♪", "zh": "和小环们一起比赛吧！\n看谁游得最快，一决胜负吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1020_p", "source_sha256": "48ee482039e66378b8420340a3b8b5d1f3e2f23b5213cdbc837dea31ad2993f3", "ja": "え？　いや、俺はいいよ。水着もないし……。", "zh": "诶？不了，我就算了。我也没带泳装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "fa90d8604ba7bbc40917efb9a28e5f7d256a77843255419f238356c2f8c0c466", "ja": "えーっ、そっか……あ、でも、水着がなくても、\n砂でお城作ったりとかなら、できるよね？", "zh": "诶——这样啊……啊，不过，就算没有泳衣，堆沙子城堡之类的，还是能做到的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1022_040tam", "source_sha256": "8a606a1475f5e190c827aa568dcff2ef0cad587e0e37e63caf412015b4e9d75a", "ja": "もうお仕事ないんでしょ～？\nおやぶんと一緒に遊びたいよ～！", "zh": "已经没有工作了吧～？\n环想跟老大一起玩嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1023_p", "source_sha256": "31b096f97efdf578aa92b125f3f56d2d4f754affa99a362558890db0f90b2ee6", "ja": "いや……そうか、うん、そうだよな！\nわかったよ、今日は思いっきり遊ぼうか。", "zh": "不对……是啊，嗯，你说得对！\n我知道了，今天就痛痛快快地玩个够吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "1a1af8797627c2359d1c8fdf144c6f3253a519e4ac7db68199f2db9482a2c0c3", "ja": "やったーっ！　うみみとおやぶんと三人で、\nでっかいお城を作るぞ～♪", "zh": "太好了！环、老大，我们三个人一起，\n来造一座超大的城堡吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1025_040tam", "source_sha256": "95b4623797b9ce94b8908355dc8bc01bacb737c8a2c99f78de578219c8e5963c", "ja": "それから、それから……！　くふふ～♪", "zh": "然后，然后……！咕呼呼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0204_1026_p", "source_sha256": "b58732619b543c67e10412af5937eb1de8746af89e695605373f63a24cd42550", "ja": "（南海の日差しを映して、環の目は輝いていた。\n楽しい仕事になって、本当によかったな）", "zh": "（环的双眼映照着南海的阳光，闪闪发亮。\n能接到这么有趣的工作，真是太好了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
